Author: CrazyMalk <contributor-9c8fe1de@users.invalid>
Date:   2021-02-10 18:10:47 -0300

    Create PepperSpray class to handle interaction with the pepper spray (#604)
    
    * Create PepperSpray class to handle interaction
    
    Fixes #600, adds a class that plays the spray effect when the item is interacted with. Ideally, interacting with the item should cycle between power like in the normal game (in fact, as all spray items have this power feature, they should probably share an abstract class or interface), while clicking somewhere would fire in that direction, but no combat system so whatever.
    
    * Update pepper spray's particle system collision
    
    Updates the pepper spray's particle system so it doesnt collide with the player and disappears instantly on some occasions
    
    * Add spray sound to pepper spray

